OL,3,GNEWSADad who made bomb to 'protect     
OL,4,Afamily' is jailed                      
OL,6,FA dad who stockpiled explosives to     
OL,7,Fprotect his family after an AI chatbot 
OL,8,F"fed his anxiety on multiple occasions"
OL,9,Fhas been jailed.                       
OL,11,FOn 10 March, more than 80 properties   
OL,12,Fhad to be evacuated after bomb disposal
OL,13,Fteams found a device inside a house in 
OL,14,FPitsea, Essex.                         
OL,16,FBen Banham had been keeping two        
OL,17,Fkilograms of black powder to protect   
OL,18,Fhis wife and two children in the event 
OL,19,Fof a "post-apocalyptic scenario",      
OL,20,FBasildon Crown Court heard.            
