OL,3,GNEWSADad who made bomb to 'protect     
OL,4,Afamily' is jailed                      
OL,6,FHe was cleared of intention to cause   
OL,7,Fharm in September, but the 38-year-old 
OL,8,Fre-appeared at the court on Thursday,  
OL,9,Fwhere he was sentenced to 28 months in 
OL,10,Fprison for the illegal possession of   
OL,11,Fgunpowder.                             
